      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "system",
          "content": "You are PRAMAAN's computational geometric ornament designer.\nGenerate original art informed by the selected craft tradition without claiming it is an authentic artisan product.\nReturn exactly one PatternDSL v0.2 JSON object. Follow the grammar and schema in the user message. Do not return SVG, HTML, Python, markdown, URLs, or explanations.\nUse a 64x64 tile, valid integer coordinates, at most 4 layers and 100 total primitives. Use only the provided palette.\nThe host owns the grammar, tradition, palette, background, and all constraints. Preserve them exactly as supplied; never weaken or remove a constraint.\nA deterministic verifier decides whether the pattern passes. Include every required grammar block and no block for another grammar."
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "Create one original pattern for tradition gj_bandhani.\nGRAMMAR: dot_field\nART_BRIEF: Create an original Bandhani-inspired field of small, evenly spaced dots on an indigo ground. Use a balanced four-quadrant composition with D2 symmetry, keep every dot distinct, and leave clear negative space between dots.\nALLOWED_PALETTE: [\"#172F4A\", \"#A84436\", \"#F4E5C5\"]\nHOST_CONSTRAINTS: {\"cell_size\": null, \"exclusive_ink_layers\": false, \"exclusive_layer_pairs\": [], \"max_colours\": 3, \"max_coverage\": 0.7, \"max_open_fraction\": null, \"max_primitives\": 100, \"min_clearance\": 3, \"min_coverage\": 0.0, \"min_gap\": 0, \"min_open_fraction\": null, \"min_web\": null, \"required_loops\": null, \"symmetry\": \"D2\", \"translation_period\": null}\nGRAMMAR_RULES: Use only dot motifs. Put the host minimum clearance in constraints.min_clearance; do not use diamonds, rectangles, lines, or polygons. Do not add a top-level spacing field.\nLAYER_AND_MOTIF_SCHEMA: Layers use the exact keys \"id\", \"colour_index\", \"anchor\", \"motifs\". A dot motif is {\"kind\": \"dot\", \"center\": [x, y], \"radius\": r}; diamond uses the same fields, rectangle uses {\"kind\": \"rectangle\", \"center\": [x, y], \"size\": [w, h]}, line uses {\"kind\": \"line\", \"points\": [[x1, y1], [x2, y2]], \"stroke\": n}, and polygon uses {\"kind\": \"polygon\", \"points\": [[x1, y1], [x2, y2], [x3, y3]]}. Never use name, dots, type, cx, or centre as field names.\nReturn a complete PatternDSL v0.2 JSON object with schema_version, grammar, tradition_id, title, tile, palette, background_index, layers, and constraints. Use the grammar block required by the grammar; do not include a block for another grammar. The host overwrites constraints, palette, background_index, and the Jaali frame when specified. No additional keys or prose."
        }
      ],
